# Problem Set 9.1
## Electrical Energy and Power

$$$$

### Problems
#### Holt Practice A pp. 599 - Electrical Potential Energy
1. As a particle moves 10.0 m along an electric field of strength 75 N/C, its electrical potential energy decreases by $$4.8 \times 10^{-16} \, J$. What is the charge of the particle?
2. What is the potential difference between the initial and final locations of the particle in Problem 1?
3. An electron moves 4.5 m in the direction of tan electric field strength 325 N/C. Determine the change in electric potential energy.

#### Holt Practice B pp. 607 - Capacitance
4. $C = \frac{Q}{\Delta V}$
